Background_Logos_520px_040126_Sorare.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2226/sm_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Sorare.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2226/md_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Sorare.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2226/lg_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Sorare.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2226/xl_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Sorare.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2226/xxl_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Sorare.jpg","With over three billion fans around the world, football (or soccer in the United States) is the largest sport on the planet—and it’s only getting bigger. As football’s popularity continues to rise, fans are looking for more opportunities to engage with the players and teams they love. Sorare, the leader in global fantasy football powered by NFTs, is providing that experience. The platform allows users to collect and trade licensed cards of their favorite players with guaranteed scarcity, construct a fantasy line-up and win cryptocurrency and other prizes based on real-world performance. \r\n\r\nPowered by NFTs on the Ethereum blockchain, Sorare has been offering football NFTs since 2019 and was one of the first movers in the space. The football world has already thrown its weight behind the fast-growing startup, which has licensing agreements with over 180 global professional clubs. With the NBA and MLB now also on the docket, Sorare is well on its way to becoming one of the largest gaming companies on the planet.","Sorare is the leading global fantasy football platform powered by NFTs where users collect and trade officially licensed cards of their favorite players.","Sorare - IVP Portfolio - NFT-Powered Gaming Venture Capital","Sorare - IVP Portfolio ","The fantasy football platform",{"id":32,"alt":8,"caption":9,"assetUrl":9,"assetUrlXs":9,"assetUrlSm":9,"assetUrlMd":9,"assetUrlLg":9,"a